{"text": "Outside, the night was cold and wet, but in the small parlor of Laburnum Villa the fire burned brightly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Mister White and his son Herbert were playing chess, while Missus White sat knitting quietly by the fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hearing the gate bang loudly, Mister White hurried to the door to welcome their guest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The guest was Sergeant Major Morris, a tall, strong soldier who had spent twenty one years in India. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sitting by the fire, he told them stories of wild scenes, brave deeds, wars, and strange peoples. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Mister White asked about a monkeys paw that Morris had once mentioned, and the soldiers face became serious. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He took a small, dried paw out of his pocket and said that an old holy man had put a spell on it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He wanted to show that fate ruled peoples lives, and that those who interfered with it did so to their sorrow, Morris said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Three different men could each have three wishes from it, and Morris himself had already had his three. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The first man had his three wishes, he said quietly, but his third wish was for death.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "u", "t", "s", "i", "d", "e", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "o", "l", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "e", "t", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "p", "a", "r", "l", "o", "r", " ", "o", "f", " ", "L", "a", "b", "u", "r", "n", "u", "m", " ", "V", "i", "l", "l", "a", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "e", " ", "b", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "M", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "W", "h", "i", "t", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " 